{"version":1,"content":"<p>台灣天團五月天多年來巡演行程密集，成員石頭除了背着結他在舞台上奔跑，也經常跪地演奏，長時間、高強度的演出，令他長期受腰椎移位問題困擾，嚴重時甚至痛到無法站立，還伴隨下肢麻痹等症狀。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;2024年8月，</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:44.573977+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T18:01:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.632999+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.632999+00:00","content_hash":"941fd327c4f4a1a52050c1e8d5f16cb0156af714f8efc7e93e87571cf01adb9c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}